{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":321303,\"title\":\"DUALIAM\",\"tagline\":\"One body. Two souls.\",\"overview\":\"When reality begins to feel unstable, Liam Garcia finds himself caught between what is real and what lies beneath. As strange events start to unfold around him, his perception of the world and of himself begins to shift. With his sister Gosia by his side, he is drawn into a growing darkness that refuses to be ignored.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gnuQhkJXIIaedxR27YWVucthYsc.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/37q7Och8lmsXe8UltZXeqUfC1r2.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Planned\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":30,\"createdBy\":[\"Rayan Hamda Barhoumi\"],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"US\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-02-02\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":6187336,\"name\":\"Niel Majedri\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5939658,\"name\":\"Rayan Hamda Barhoumi\",\"character\":\"Liam Garcia\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zHM6ShO5uL8JMYstQIvGEN2vokc.jpg\"},{\"id\":6182927,\"name\":\"Elena Kowalska\",\"character\":\"Gosia Garcia\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wfDyTFcqNRL6OEbe0mjLebtm6ZV.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"8VmEECqnxSw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"KyFmS3wRPCQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"hnQRUHcLNYo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":63470,\"title\":\"Cheo Yong\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3m7XYqhkzP6GWRBDkPQSSMxWk53.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2803030303030303,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"After the unexplained disappearance of their father, Liam Garcia and his sister Gosia try to move forward with their lives. But when Liam begins to notice subtle inconsistencies in reality, what first seems insignificant slowly turns into something far more unsettling. As strange patterns emerge and his perception begins to fracture, Liam is drawn toward a truth he cannot fully understand. The deeper he goes, the more everything around him begins to change leading him to a choice that will alter everything.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gnuQhkJXIIaedxR27YWVucthYsc.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2026-02-02\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Something Feels Off\",\"overview\":\"Liam Garcia lives a quiet and uneventful life alongside his sister Gosia, still marked by the unexplained absence of their father. While trying to move forward, Liam begins to notice subtle inconsistencies in his surroundings. What first seems insignificant slowly turns into something far more unsettling, as reality itself starts to feel unstable.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-02\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Mark\",\"overview\":\"Liam becomes increasingly fixated on a symbol he cannot fully remember, yet cannot forget. Convinced that what he saw was real, he returns to the house only to find no trace of it. As his attempts to recreate the symbol fail, subtle inconsistencies begin to surface, deepening his obsession. Meanwhile, Gosia senses a change in him, unaware of what he is starting to uncover.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Echoes\",\"overview\":\"As Liam begins experiencing brief and disjointed flashes, one of them lingers longer than it should. What once felt like a passing disturbance suddenly becomes something real, as an unseen presence seems to respond to him. Unable to explain what he has just experienced, Liam is left questioning not only his perception—but the nature of what may be reaching back.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Unseen Patterns\",\"overview\":\"As the strange events continue, Liam begins to pay closer attention to the details around him. Though nothing seems to connect clearly, recurring elements start to emerge in subtle and unsettling ways. Driven by a growing sense that something is wrong, he attempts to make sense of it all while at the same time questioning his own perception of reality.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Empty Room\",\"overview\":\"After being unexpectedly sent back to a property he thought he was done with, Liam is forced to confront something he cannot explain. Inside the house, a space appears that defies all logic, existing in a way that should not be possible. As he tries to understand what he is seeing, doubt and certainty begin to collide, pushing him closer to a truth he is not ready to face.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"What Was Left Behind\",\"overview\":\"Searching for answers, Liam begins to look through what remains of his father’s belongings. Among forgotten objects and hidden traces, he uncovers a symbol disturbingly similar to the one he cannot forget. As fragments of the past begin to surface, Liam is drawn deeper into a mystery that feels both distant and strangely familiar.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The First Trace\",\"overview\":\"Guided by increasingly intense flashes, Liam is led to a place connected to a recent and unexplained disappearance. What begins as a search for answers quickly turns into a direct confrontation with something far beyond his understanding. As the encounter turns physical, reality itself begins to distort around him. Overwhelmed and unprepared, Liam barely escapes, realizing for the first time that what he is facing is not only real but dangerous.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Instinct\",\"overview\":\"Struggling to make sense of what he has experienced, Liam finds himself caught between denial and understanding. As he begins to both analyze and act on the patterns he has observed, his behavior grows increasingly unpredictable. While he tries to regain control, Gosia becomes more aware that something is deeply wrong without knowing how far Liam has already gone.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Crossing Lines\",\"overview\":\"As Liam becomes more capable in facing what he does not fully understand, his behavior grows increasingly unstable. The line between control and obsession begins to blur, leading him to take greater risks. When the consequences of his actions begin to reach closer to home, Gosia finds herself caught in a situation she cannot explain, forcing Liam to confront the danger he has brought into her life.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Shift\",\"overview\":\"As the events surrounding him reach their breaking point, Liam is forced into a moment where action comes before understanding. When a dangerous exchange unfolds before him, he intervenes without fully grasping the consequences. In doing so, Liam makes a choice that alters everything leaving behind a reality that no longer holds him.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"\",\"runtime\":55}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2026-02-02\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}